  "description": "A year after divorce In Luxembourg, where she visited again with best-selling writer Min-hoo, Hee-young will reunite with Jin-seok. Jin-seok, who is shaken by Lina's confession for 10 years there, and Hee-young, who longs for a new romance. Europe, with five men and women, is indifferently fresh as if they do not know their conflict. And the brutal reality of love and marriage revealed through travel...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/rediscovery), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/travel/?p_id=tw1984), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000056459)",
